Mighty Mike: controls
=====================

The keys as the game sets them the first time (Settings, then Configure
keyboard, changes them; they are kept in the drawer's User drawer).

  Cursor keys or W A S D   walk
  Space or Ctrl            fire
  Left Shift or Left Alt   next weapon
  Right Shift or Right Alt previous weapon
  R or Tab                 radar
  M                        music on and off
  Esc                      pause and the menu

The menu: cursor keys and Return, Esc or Backspace goes back. A mouse
(left button fires, middle shows the radar, the wheel picks the weapon),
a joystick or a gamepad works too.
